  "title": "Baked \"Fried\" Rice",
  "description": "Chef John's baked \"fried\" rice will satisfy your cravings for true fried rice, and it doesn't require leftover rice. Perfect clump-free texture every time!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-03-27T01:44:02-04:00",
